>> Because the rest of the document suggests that we always use the TLS =
1.3
>> Certificate, but this line would set us up for using a TLS 1.2
>> Certificate.
>>=20
>> [ns] They do not include the actual message structure. The =
constraints
>> are about the certificate_list. I=E2=80=99ve updated the text.
